Ipuy
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
PEKU 10 FACE_ALL
PEKU 0 FACE_LAST
PEKU 1 FACE_LAST
PEKU 2 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE_STACK PEKU PEKU
AND
    DEST Suit {CLUBS, HEARTS, DIAMONDS, SPADES}
    OR
        SRCSTACK Size >= 10
        DESTSRC Rank equal
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL PEKU Empty
        PILE ALL PEKU Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL PEKU Empty
        PILE ALL PEKU Empty
